WHAT YOU MAY DO

  - Read, save and share these documents, in whole or in part, by any medium.
  - Link to them, quote them and embed them, as long as credit is given.

  Credit means naming the author (Gabriel Eich), naming the work (Companion Dogs
  documentation), and linking back to this repository or to the published site.


WHAT YOU MAY NOT DO

  - Use this material commercially, including reposting it behind ads or on a
    site whose primary purpose is commercial gain.
  - Publish a modified, translated or otherwise derived version of it. You may
    create derivatives privately; you may not distribute them.
  - Republish these documents as your own work, or as documentation for a
    re-upload of the mod.


